       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/jn038xx9588.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Lower panel upright. Five pencil figures on bare paper, nothing else in the crop and no name. 2 (looped top, base swept right), 8 (two stacked loops), 7 (crossed, with the diagonal running below the baseline), 2, 2. The fourth figure has no descender, so it is a 2 and not the 9 a first glance suggests. The fifth is over-inked at the top but has the same looped top and right-swept base as the first and fourth. Read as the run-together day-month-year of the corpus, 28.7.22; the parse rests on that convention, since no separators are written."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
